  "about": {
    "title": "About the Mysterious Treasures set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Mysterious Treasures is a Diamond & Pearl expansion released on 1 August 2007. It has 124 cards: 123 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 120 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 123 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (243 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 244 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
